## OPEN TASK — reference-drawer bug cluster (NEXT SESSION, ===5=== granted, q1a decided)

Same surface as the kebab backlog (`memory/backlog_kebab_video_reference_zones.md`). One coherent pass.
Root causes fully mapped this session:

1. **select_attempt duplicates** — `app/api/assets/[id]/regenerate-image/route.ts:330-341` APPENDS a copy
   of the chosen attempt to `generation_history` each click; `AttemptsStrip` re-renders it (11→12 tiles).
   Fix: select-in-place — set a `selected_version` pointer on `shot_reference` + repoint image fields;
   do NOT append a duplicate. Handler = `promoteAttempt` (`components/assets/EpisodeAssetDrawer.tsx:524`);
   strip = `components/assets/EREFv2Sections.tsx:458-585` (highlight the selected tile).
2. **Reject no-op on APPROVED** — `lib/api/status-transitions.ts:27` (`APPROVED → REJECTED` not allowed);
   `approve/route.ts:133` throws. **DIRECTOR DECISION q1a:** Reject on an already-APPROVED asset should
   route to `REVISION` (FSM-allowed) = "send back to redo", NOT hard REJECTED. Implement in the drawer
   `postDecision`/approve route: when asset is APPROVED and decision=REJECT → target REVISION.
3. **Approve "already approved"** — `approve/route.ts:166-170` idempotency guard; select_attempt keeps
   status APPROVED. Fix: drawer status-aware footer — hide/disable Approve when already APPROVED (show
   "✓ Approved"); surface variant-pick as its own applied state.
4. **Kebab two zones + smart Generate button** (from backlog): split the per-shot dossier into REFERENCE
   zone {ref_plan, ref_image} and VIDEO zone {shot_plan, video}, each version stack labelled. Generate-
   video button must check plan: none→create; APPROVED→render; REVIEW/REVISION→tell the presser (don't
   silently re-fire Designer — the live spend bug in commit `3d29b73`'s else-branch).

Verify: `cd webapp && npx tsc --noEmit` · `vitest run` · `replay-pilot`. No `npm run build` while dev up.
Don't restart the inngest worker (Polina live on E13).

